{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TwentyOne</strong> is a psychological single-player card game set in a <strong>corrupted city</strong> where a criminal mastermind runs an illegal gambling competition for his own sick entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Gambit, a young man <strong>desperately</strong> trying to save his collapsing family by joining this high-stakes rat race. Face off in blackjack against a series of unique opponents, each bringing their own <strong>twisted rules</strong> and dark energy to the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the stakes rise, Gambit\u2019s grip on reality slips. Watch as he falls into madness, plagued by hallucinations and a <strong>deteriorating mental state</strong>. To Gambit, there is only one goal left: become the <strong>Family Savior</strong>, no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/2112f997b150ac9d36c4288c64e7863a.poster.avif?t=1774169892\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/2112f997b150ac9d36c4288c64e7863a.webm?t=1774169892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/2112f997b150ac9d36c4288c64e7863a.mp4?t=1774169892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Blackjack:</strong> Every opponent introduces a fresh, rule-bending twist to the classic game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narratives:</strong> Every competitor has a personal backstory\u2014engage in dialogue to uncover their secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices and performance determine the ultimate fate of Gambit and his family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narrative Confrontation:</strong> Engage in unsettling dialogues that blur the line between the character and the player.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ol' Vet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733940/d86497a32e462ccc86972259e7cf5684bb31f5ee.jpg"},{"name":"Bomboclat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733940/244f98e66f331faf4d2137a95ce30d90e498013e.jpg"},{"name":"Short lifespan motherf*cker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733940/8030c87aa1d8c28a2e73513d55026a64873294c7.jpg"},{"name":"High as the sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733940/7628b2b6e82459da7f0aa779864ef431092c2330.jpg"},{"name":"Even Leo wasn't this high","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733940/1b095895299a1ecfb8b5a2f1d6cf8310ff0c8163.jpg"},{"name":"Can't get higher than this bro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733940/99c9f0128184c3219bf1867c64918f392d2fa36d.jpg"},{"name":"Tough life, escapee...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733940/b0625eaaa73cf3e6bc11797aeb09e45af3283a0d.jpg"},{"name":"Back to the end","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733940/ddfda394f232dae2846315454488124d212b1ed5.jpg"},{"name":"Is this it?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733940/d78dd4984d2273f0e6b8bf05b9a85905faa5d8b9.jpg"},{"name":"Congrats! You schizo...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733940/252ae3c9bb4110081917c9970c0c11d3167fcc92.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733940?t